b)"}, "_lifecycle_floor": "candidate-explanation"}], "conclusion": "## Claims\nThe hypothesis holds on all six criteria (7/7 tests passed). The criteria were fixed before the canonical runs but after a pilot that included severity 0.2 and 0.8; the unseen points (0.4, 0.6, 1.0) fall where the hypothesis predicts.\n\n## Limitations\nOne patient, one site and 10 minutes. The time at which MAP leaves its starting band is not reported: beat-to-beat dips cross a 2 mmHg band before any sustained fall.\n", "interface": {"composite": null, "config": {}, "inputs": [], "outputs": [], "emitter": null}, "feedback_tracked": {"items": [], "summary": {"open": 0, "addressed": 0, "dismissed": 0, "total": 0}}, "feedback_actions": {"items": [], "summary": {"open": 0, "applied": 0, "dismissed": 0, "total": 0}}, "derived_status": {"simulation_status": {"value": "ran", "source": "18 completed run(s)"}, "evaluation_status": {"value": "evaluated", "source": "completed run + recorded verdicts"}}, "clarity_summary": {"ran": {"status": "ran", "n_runs": 18, "latest": null, "label": "Ran \u00b7 18 runs"}, "tests": {"total": 2, "pass": 0, "fail": 0, "skip": 0, "pending": 2, "label": "Tests: 2\u23f3"}, "verdict": {"value": "passed", "label": "Passed", "glyph": "\u2705", "cls": "v-pass"}, "ambiguities": ["ran, but every test renders 'pending' \u2014 no run outcomes recorded (add runs[].outcomes so the tests show pass/fail)"]}, "computed_gate_verdict": {"result": "blocked", "blocked_by": ["blood-loss-rises-with-severity", "pressure-held-until-severe"], "evaluated_by": "code", "diverges_from_authored": true, "counts": {"total": 2, "pass": 0, "fail": 0, "skip": 0, "pending": 2}}, "verdict_count_split": {"committed_rerunnable": 0, "regression_pins": {"total": 0, "pass": 0, "fail": 0}, "acceptance_criteria": {"total": 0, "pass": 0, "fail": 0}, "expected_fail": {"total": 0, "behaved": 0}, "narrated": 2, "unclassified": 0, "label": "pins: 0/0; acceptance: 0/0; narrated: 2"}, "preregistration_status": {"pr